# PowerCore chat contract

Any PowerCore LLM chat UI (Notes assistant, Vault Vincent, future surfaces) must follow
`powercore-ops/chat_contract/` — prompt_core, ui_defaults, shared history schema, and
**shared AI prefs** (`prefs.json`: favorites + sticky model).

## Do

- Compose: core → product overlay → custom instructions
- History rail + chevron; copy/fork/redo on assistant replies
- Enter sends; Shift+Enter newline
- Markdown subset for replies where the stack allows
- `POWERCORE_ENTITLEMENT_DEV` unlocks chat surfaces (no upsell)
- Favorites / sticky route+model via `%LOCALAPPDATA%\PowerCore\chat\prefs.json` (not a per-app-only store)

## Do not

- Invent a second system-prompt style per product
- Ship chat UIs without history + completion actions without an explicit exception
- Invent a third favorites store when `chat_contract.prefs` exists

Canonical: `C:\Powercore-repo-main\powercore-ops\chat_contract\README.md`

Scroll/focus/rail feel across apps: skill `powercore-ux-prefs` +
`powercore-ops/design/powercore-ux.preferences.md` (do not fork competing rules).
